        "rationale": "The previous measured solver reached loss_total 33.005. Using the same public observations, I locally optimized the anisotropic blend and nearest correction, then tested monotone sign-preserving transforms because the host reinitializes the field and the zero crossing is sub-cell sensitive. The updated blend (0.475 narrow component, 0.04 nearest correction) followed by exponent 1.22 reduced local loss to 32.948 (drillhole 7.591, outcrop 25.357). It preserves both signs, passes the public selfcheck, and remains fully input-driven with generic 2D/sketch fallbacks."
